, "localId": "e88cfcd7-adb2-48e8-b864-507df0cf1771"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7e53f48d06a9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "(aucune) : ligne ignorée avec un avertissement si la valeur manque"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "0f821fc4-04b3-47d5-902c-a2d0f9ebd74a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b6865c9cf861"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nom canonique du type d'échantillon (par exemple « Whole Blood »). Sert aussi à rechercher un enregistrement existant si "}, {"type": "text", "text": "localAbbreviation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ne correspond à aucun."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "a91dcf9e-b966-40d6-9eb5-a3d3bd406e3f"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "f0e9256a-38ab-4575-8c80-b95c67b68b40"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7ae914129315"}, "content": [{"text": "localAbbreviation", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "9a0fc02e-09ac-4fbb-bc58-6089c950107c"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b882b3a2bfed"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Oui", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "2d4ad039-b140-40dc-a2ea-a96b9c8784e9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a0ae65011c2d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "(aucune) : ligne ignorée avec un avertissement si la valeur manque"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "1c13bf54-0af9-4202-aa8e-2226c229cdb5"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "aec100fc5f2d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Code court (par exemple « WB », « SER »). Utilisé avec "}, {"type": "text", "text": "domain", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " comme clé de recherche principale pour décider entre mise à jour et création."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "f6bcd78f-0f75-4b82-8c43-23598f2e7e7e"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "f6a432fa-dc9a-46d2-be47-d2df9d0dad57"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4caf56b1d292"}, "content": [{"text": "domain", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "74df40db-819a-4887-8200-eff16c3b31fe"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "74bb4108760c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3f20ace4-679a-47ec-a58b-93496822a791"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6dfa3646fa99"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "H", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (humain)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "2a3e7548-0759-4aa9-9aab-f86882ad2bdc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dbb357d7b701"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Code de domaine sur une seule lettre. Seul « H » figure dans les valeurs par défaut du code ; ce champ permet de distinguer des domaines d'échantillons (par exemple humain et non humain) si un déploiement en définit d'autres."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "86cbd312-b176-4ee1-a1c7-d2edcfd0e5f3"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "ebc60e1f-2135-4aef-9781-693d5d31f9a9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6ef6649ee184"}, "content": [{"text": "isActive", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "0b8c2a4d-443f-45cc-82a1-603312eee148"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bf33399e7e20"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "8f811623-fc19-49e7-9c23-6fbb8a24a2b2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "41f25bdf5f34"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Y", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (vrai) à la création ; inchangé lors d'une mise à jour si vide"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "26b10158-934e-44c8-b69d-7c923fbc3f98"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a7d67952e5ec"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accepte "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Y", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "/"}, {"type": "text", "text": "true", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (sans distinction de casse) comme actif ; toute autre valeur est considérée comme inactive."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "2858f95f-c3dd-4bb9-b57e-8640dd3b216a"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "da99c915-4f38-4dda-bf6a-2e834beb35ba"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e91aebd654b3"}, "content": [{"text": "sortOrder", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "7cedf2bb-5d9b-4c6a-8958-07482d835e53"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ec8f2bfa24ac"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "cc04dc1c-0ef1-486e-839d-d179ebd13e6b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "59e77eddc2fb"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Attribué automatiquement : "}, {"type": "text", "text": "(current max sortOrder across all existing sample types) + 1", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", incrémenté à chaque ligne du fichier"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5dafaf85-bc60-4d92-b17a-be57c50937df"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "45ee2d64ecc1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Doit pouvoir être lu comme un entier s'il est renseigné ; une valeur invalide est remplacée par la valeur attribuée automatiquement, avec un avertissement dans le journal."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "832c1542-7a50-41f1-abe5-0aa7cd7021ef"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3f246995-f73a-4d01-aced-c883a5db718d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5c18e0266d95"}, "content": [{"text": "englishName", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "4fc4aa11-2889-43ce-95ad-007779463f40"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d75632521a3b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "2aa51295-8c0a-4fe3-9b4c-03bab11c340b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "13f4b58951b4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reprend "}, {"type": "text", "text": "description", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3bc8e513-da67-46d7-93ce-1cfb87b0ae56"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f8c6a262893c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sert à créer ou mettre à jour l'entrée "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Localization", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (anglais) du type d'échantillon."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "10c0de0c-80bf-45fe-be35-c0471738bcdd"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "45b75958-cb9b-4d3a-9138-bb952845ef83"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "acb48955c5b9"}, "content": [{"text": "frenchName", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "14600e9d-53f2-4ff0-8837-ecfd59caafc5"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a200ae0a93e2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "f1fcc355-8bae-4a7d-ac3d-a55677c5216d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "49b7a820135e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reprend "}, {"type": "text", "text": "englishName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "660b3d8f-d3f3-4144-99df-4daee569c48d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "249afd8c2b70"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sert à créer ou mettre à jour l'entrée "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Localization", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (français) du type d'échantillon."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "caf85ce522df"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Seules les colonnes "}, {"type": "text", "text": "description", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et "}, {"type": "text", "text": "localAbbreviation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " sont strictement obligatoires dans la ligne d'en-tête : le chargeur génère une erreur (et rejette tout le fichier) si l'une d'elles est totalement absente."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "a3e97a3cd4ff"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fichier d'exemple"}]}, {"type": "codeBlock", "attrs": {"localId": "649c2c06-e466-4d0b-9dfd-54a431cc248b", "wrap": true}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"text": "description,localAbbreviation,domain,isActive,sortOrder,englishName,frenchName\nWhole Blood,WB,H,Y,1,Whole Blood,Sang Total\nSerum,SER,H,Y,2,Serum,Sérum\nPlasma,PLS,H,Y,3,Plasma,Plasma\nUrine,UR,H,Y,4,Urine,Urine\nStool,STL,H,Y,5,Stool,Selles\nCerebrospinal Fluid,CSF,H,Y,6,Cerebrospinal Fluid,Liquide Céphalo-Rachidien\nSputum,SPT,H,Y,7,Sputum,Expectoration\nSwab,SWB,H,Y,8,Swab,Écouvillon\nTissue,TIS,H,Y,9,Tissue,Tissu\nSaliva,SAL,H,Y,10,Saliva,Salive\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bb98ae845e09"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "(Il s'agit du fichier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "example-sample-types.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " fourni : copiez-le dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/sample-types/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et renommez-le, par exemple en "}, {"type": "text", "text": "madagascar-sample-types.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", pour qu'il soit chargé. Les fichiers placés dans un sous-dossier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "examples/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " sont ignorés à dessein.)"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "6ab2f82bff03"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Correspondance et choix entre création et mise à jour"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8248693633e7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour chaque ligne de données :"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "45e12f85-1a44-4ccb-bf38-78d51a223a43", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "e503cee9-9969-4d75-bdcb-d5c6453e3609"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1571eb31d823"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Recherche d'un type d'échantillon existant par "}, {"type": "text", "text": "localAbbreviation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " + ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "domain", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "ce40f823-261b-40e4-a4a3-9b447009cccd"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "22e222adda23"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "À défaut, recherche par "}, {"type": "text", "text": "description", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " + ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "domain", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "2dc74cce-64b3-485f-9051-e0a3dc445c3b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ee25c2a1a855"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si une correspondance est trouvée → mise à jour de la description, de l'abréviation, de l'indicateur actif (si "}, {"type": "text", "text": "isActive", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " est fourni), de l'ordre de tri (si fourni) et de la localisation anglaise/française (si fournie)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "f2a59263-2187-4931-94c1-1d37ca043a36"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "50c4327930e9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si aucune correspondance n'est trouvée → création d'un nouveau "}, {"type": "text", "text": "TypeOfSample", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et d'un enregistrement "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Localization", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " associé, puis insertion avec l'indicateur actif et l'ordre de tri retenus."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "74f777885372"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vous pouvez donc relancer le même CSV sans risque (idempotent au niveau de la ligne), tant que "}, {"type": "text", "text": "localAbbreviation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "/"}, {"type": "text", "text": "domain", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "description", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "/"}, {"type": "text", "text": "domain", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " restent stables : le chargeur met à jour au lieu de dupliquer."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "01198ac49908"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Détails d'analyse syntaxique à connaître"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "cf85d8aa-18bd-44af-a774-b57fe79c1f8b"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "ea7328f3-e909-4110-8f3e-35745e7cb036"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6430260a4bc1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'analyseur CSV est une petite implémentation maison qui prend en charge les champs entre guillemets doubles (les valeurs contenant des virgules doivent donc être entre guillemets) ; il ne prend "}, {"type": "text", "text": "pas", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " en charge les guillemets échappés à l'intérieur d'un champ entre guillemets."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "eb7bc452-b3af-4557-93d1-c292f5abb627"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bf59a737c55e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'ordre des colonnes dans l'en-tête n'a pas d'importance : les colonnes sont repérées par leur nom (sans distinction de casse), et non par leur position."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "48afa398-543c-4592-8d4d-42e89a28f7db"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e5ad9f9367b5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les lignes vides sont ignorées."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "aa1a49e8-2c0c-414a-b5c1-738c7cbe53ba"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7971cc935bae"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Toute exception au niveau d'une ligne est journalisée et la ligne est ignorée ; le reste du fichier continue d'être traité."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "b8593890-1bcd-4fb6-8bdf-ac6ffa31c8ad"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "52e1368bb545"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Après le traitement, le chargeur vide le cache "}, {"type": "text", "text": "TypeOfSampleService", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et appelle "}, {"type": "text", "text": "DisplayListService.refreshLists()", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", de sorte que les types d'échantillons nouveaux ou modifiés apparaissent immédiatement dans les listes déroulantes, sans redémarrage."}]}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "aee5ad15-d525-40be-8070-d505677a5f04"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "bed3fc936f7d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Partie 2 : associer les analyses aux types d'échantillons ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "test-sample-types", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f2a21c66a819"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Il s'agit d'un domaine et d'un gestionnaire distincts, qui relient des "}, {"type": "text", "text": "analyses", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " déjà définies à des "}, {"type": "text", "text": "types d'échantillons", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " déjà définis, c'est-à-dire les types d'échantillons valides pour une analyse donnée (par exemple, la glycémie peut être réalisée sur sérum, plasma ou sang total)."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "aeaa577ab621"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pourquoi ce domaine est chargé à l'ordre 210"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "243af8542ac1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Il dépend à la fois :"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "1a9145d9-894f-4e5a-9dfa-401a79f58821"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "2c3a6451-64ce-4e76-ba23-29b8f432915f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f234e8e30ff0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "de "}, {"type": "text", "text": "test-sections", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "/"}, {"type": "text", "text": "sample-types", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (ordre 100, entités de base), et"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "550479fb-72d3-4bf8-a7d9-bb5a0ae023d2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "18416d69464a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "de "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (ordre 200) : l'analyse doit déjà exister."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f31281ac3a80"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si une analyse ou un type d'échantillon référencé n'existe pas encore, la ligne de mappage est ignorée avec un avertissement (elle n'est ni mise en file d'attente ni retentée). L'ordre entre fichiers au sein d'un même chargement compte donc si vous introduisez en même temps une analyse et son mappage à un type d'échantillon : "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et "}, {"type": "text", "text": "test-sample-types/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " sont lus lors du même passage au démarrage, mais le gestionnaire des analyses s'exécute en premier en raison de l'ordre de chargement."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "371dabb5fb42"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Emplacement des fichiers"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "ccb4b6cf-f5e7-4b02-bcd7-d91b13fa4272"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "302398b4-b585-4c00-87c5-ca05befe8ad8"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a6b219bb2c5f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Classpath :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "src/main/resources/configuration/test-sample-types/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "235b96fe-8c66-4360-b826-4a70cfa6790f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "fa762cec4e66"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Système de fichiers :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "/var/lib/openelis-global/configuration/backend/test-sample-types/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "0b562e60-d30a-4cd1-bb94-b3f608fa7cb2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c813b0c06db3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Exemple :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "volume/configuration/backend/test-sample-types/example-test-sample-mappings.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "057cb6ecbe3c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Format CSV"}]}, {"type": "codeBlock", "attrs": {"localId": "53c498bb-308a-43bd-bfa3-6cbe272271fe", "wrap": true}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"text": "testName,sampleType\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "d479b757-49e9-4c5e-a69f-e30f045e4f6f"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "c6692b46-4471-4732-8e94-42d4bc3b070d"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "a4f607d8-e67e-455c-bb06-607ee2a0acfe"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "31dd191ea725"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Colonne"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "b3449240-c5d5-4b9f-874e-81f2ffef759b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ea296ddce18c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Obligatoire ?"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "a7843df8-dfaa-4087-8d13-f377bb62c5bc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f3d696e7c011"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarques"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "3ec5d170-04a0-4292-b519-b80d99746d29"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5c3e1788-2e36-416d-8cb2-e3de6f174d59"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "61570ed7f6bc"}, "content": [{"text": "testName", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "c1a63b19-4af2-4f2d-a02d-af31f63f9121"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "554f7b0988a8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Oui", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "d34565e5-3c4b-4bc9-a492-215346b41095"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "447f5b672374"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comparé, dans cet ordre, au nom localisé de l'analyse → à la description de l'analyse → au nom de l'analyse. Ligne ignorée avec un avertissement si l'analyse est introuvable."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "f28466d6-55a7-4643-9499-61e531a548c7"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "9dbb488d-d141-45df-bd4f-6363e046fcd6"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c3b0ae21f378"}, "content": [{"text": "sampleType", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "1b9b56c7-5722-423b-8b16-1819a374cb9d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dcda9f769427"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Oui", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "2594214a-3ee7-4f9d-a117-0ac303b4e9be"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "fd2fbe8dee0b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comparé au nom localisé, à la description ou à "}, {"type": "text", "text": "localAbbreviation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " d'un type d'échantillon (sans distinction de casse). Ligne ignorée avec un avertissement si aucune correspondance n'est trouvée."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "1e0fe6b2-57dd-47bc-aba3-0fc711adc826"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "9c891ace-bcbc-4984-a077-28aa87d37208"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6878509bf45e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Plusieurs lignes peuvent partager le même "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour déclarer plusieurs types d'échantillons valides pour une même analyse (c'est le cas normal : la plupart des analyses acceptent plus d'un type d'échantillon)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "6a15f821-93b6-4122-bb39-541d35eb3325"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "82c6c1230e3d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les mappages existants sont détectés et ignorés (non dupliqués) : avant toute insertion, le chargeur vérifie s'il existe déjà un lien "}, {"type": "text", "text": "TypeOfSampleTest", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " entre l'identifiant de l'analyse et celui du type d'échantillon."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "2d2847f2-a8ec-406e-baa2-840b6478f22f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a2687d39c6ee"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Il n'y a ni "}, {"type": "text", "text": "isActive", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ni "}, {"type": "text", "text": "sortOrder", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ici : un mappage existe ou n'existe pas ; la notion de mappage inactif n'existe pas dans ce format de fichier."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "e076ddaf9ac8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fichier d'exemple"}]}, {"type": "codeBlock", "attrs": {"localId": "50252beb-0b2e-4ed6-a4ed-4a02b123bce6", "wrap": true}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"text": "testName,sampleType\nComplete Blood Count,Whole Blood\nHemoglobin,Whole Blood\nHemoglobin,Serum\nGlucose,Serum\nGlucose,Plasma\nGlucose,Whole Blood\nUrinalysis,Urine\nHIV Rapid Test,Whole Blood\nHIV Rapid Test,Serum\nHIV Rapid Test,Plasma\nMalaria Rapid Test,Whole Blood\nHepatitis B Surface Antigen,Serum\nHepatitis B Surface Antigen,Plasma\nLiver Function Tests,Serum\nRenal Function Tests,Serum\nRenal Function Tests,Plasma\nLipid Profile,Serum\nLipid Profile,Plasma\nSaliva Profile,Saliva\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "464cc300-9efa-4048-96e8-1cd674040bb6"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "f8ee5e01480d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Mise en pratique pour un déploiement à Madagascar"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1a13b9c828f3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour introduire un ensemble de types d'échantillons propre au pays :"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "97d08117-202b-4192-98a8-8f37b6d0c338", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "3b40655e-7fcd-4a5a-a579-e859cb4dee98"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2d8bf273e80b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Copiez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "volume/configuration/backend/sample-types/example-sample-types.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " vers "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/sample-types/madagascar-sample-types.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (côté hôte, monté dans le conteneur), puis modifiez-le avec les types d'échantillons réellement utilisés (ajoutez les abréviations locales et les noms français selon les besoins)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "d39cfe6b-9785-45be-80e0-938def6f1dd3"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "90ff3d764ab4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vérifiez que les analyses correspondantes existent (via "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/tests/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", ordre de chargement 200) avant l'étape 3 ou lors du même passage au démarrage."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "0377618f-a438-4951-b6d1-013efc47ed5e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "62082591f12b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Copiez de la même façon "}, {"type": "text", "text": "example-test-sample-mappings.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/test-sample-types/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", et associez par leur nom chaque analyse à ses types d'échantillons valides."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7135b06b-08c1-49cb-adbf-0df21af3d0dd"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a4373886b986"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Redémarrez le conteneur (ou déclenchez autrement "}, {"type": "text", "text": "ContextRefreshedEvent", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Le chargeur va :"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "2070a80a-0f0f-49f6-852c-f12c2526dd37"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "c8699386-28bb-457c-bcf9-b8ff02c72106"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a728d278fb46"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "détecter les nouveaux fichiers (aucune somme de contrôle encore enregistrée),"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "6961e66a-cdb0-4257-8963-515d49c45fe4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d14a645afd75"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "charger d'abord "}, {"type": "text", "text": "sample-types", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (ordre 100),"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "2ca62e4a-ebdf-4e50-ba70-f030e06368e8"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "61ee032e011d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "puis "}, {"type": "text", "text": "test-sample-types", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (ordre 210), moment où les analyses et les types d'échantillons référencés existent déjà,"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "bfffc25f-b353-44c2-bbcd-b73cef738a70"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "22eb610e778a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "enregistrer les sommes de contrôle afin que les fichiers inchangés soient ignorés au redémarrage suivant."}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "87caa4ee4670"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dépannage rapide"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "b9b018b2-958d-4443-8209-748255748f5c"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "60c5d1b7-25ff-4389-a094-b9c6e2d1ad67"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "e92ef986-41e9-4125-9385-2f03b3c20278"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f56b4b6b2a42"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Symptôme"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "2b1e3281-0522-43b3-ac66-733df372f4b0"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5fdd311a93ad"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cause probable"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "50a03067-5949-478e-9124-d90a6343d49d"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "02d58747-e19a-44ea-b330-c473dcbb0e17"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "136a3d6cc2ef"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le type d'échantillon n'apparaît pas dans les listes déroulantes après le redémarrage"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "34882477-4ea7-4853-9d73-77312a39f0ee"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8ad6b1a84bf1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fichier absent de "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/sample-types/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (vérifiez la présence d'un sous-dossier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "examples/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " égaré), ou colonne "}, {"type": "text", "text": "description", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "/"}, {"type": "text", "text": "localAbbreviation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " absente ou mal orthographiée dans l'en-tête"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "936289cd-f95d-40a8-a795-52a380f1424e"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "efd66546-5de4-4c95-9c2a-ef09eb72469b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dd8f930846e6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Mappage analyse/type d'échantillon manquant sans message visible"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3156ea68-80b6-4bae-a53d-7fd581fbeab8"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2bcd4f867f2e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le nom de l'analyse ou du type d'échantillon référencé ne correspond pas exactement au nom localisé, à la description ou à l'abréviation d'un enregistrement existant (sans distinction de casse, mais identique par ailleurs) : consultez les journaux de l'application pour l'avertissement précis"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "6d137da0-b775-4b9d-b549-2a2560358602"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3b823efe-0c35-4a56-ada3-e351439669b7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1e84f3f42cac"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ordre de tri différent de celui attendu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "10ef6bd9-7108-4001-bed3-9bc5a8e0c660"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5da2dc940a43"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "sortOrder", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " laissé vide : l'attribution automatique se base sur le maximum actuel parmi "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tous", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " les types d'échantillons, incrémenté à chaque ligne ; les fichiers ajoutés tardivement se retrouvent donc à la fin, quel que soit l'ordre interne du fichier"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "8a45ffa2-5f70-49de-924f-c09d5f74f902"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3b0a6261-36d4-4ce5-b00b-89a5db7ddc62"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a442afda2dea"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le même fichier est retraité à chaque redémarrage"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "cd2a80d4-ce0e-4e5e-862f-c98b79f3a0ad"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "64df630bc807"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cela ne se produit que si le contenu du fichier a réellement changé (somme de contrôle différente) : si le retraitement est systématique, vérifiez si le fichier est régénéré avec des espaces ou des fins de ligne différents d'un build à l'autre"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "fd3167acdf36"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour aller plus loin"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "277620d3-b52c-437f-901d-2a65642fd111"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "84e53b6c-9110-4c98-b424-1e68d9cffdc1"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "575e7df48d7a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configuration-System-Overview", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : fonctionnement général du chargeur de configuration par domaine piloté par sommes de contrôle, et lien avec la configuration de déploiement et les paramètres "}, {"type": "text", "text": "SiteInformation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " à l'exécution."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "ab9a399b-09c8-4f76-a035-caa4341cb8dd"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1e0db422aca6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "docs/configuration/README.md", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : index de la documentation de configuration du projet."}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}